sequenceDiagram
    participant C as RFB client
    participant S as RFB server
    S->>C: Protocol version greeting
    C->>S: Select RFB 3.8
    S->>C: Offered security types
    C->>S: Select VNC authentication
    S->>C: Random 16-byte challenge
    C->>S: DES challenge response
    S->>C: Authentication success
    C->>S: Shared-session flag
    S->>C: Size, pixel format, desktop name
    C->>S: Request BGRX pixels and Raw encoding
    C->>S: FramebufferUpdateRequest
    S->>C: Rectangle headers and pixel bytes
    C->>S: KeyEvent / PointerEvent
    Note over C,S: Web mode carries these messages inside WebSocket frames
